# Brand assets kept locally for future use but not shipped: nothing in
# app/, components/ or lib/ references them, so committing them only
# adds weight to every clone and every deploy.
#
# Listed one by one on purpose rather than as a wildcard — public/ also
# holds the three assets the site actually renders, and a blanket rule
# here would silently drop one of them from a deploy and break the logo
# in production with no build error.
#
# In use, must stay tracked: W-White.png, W-White1.png, docs.png

Colorful.png
Stellar-White.png
Stellar-White.svg
Wasit-Docs.png
Wolf.png
docs.svg
logo - light.png
logo - light.svg
